---
code: records-sentinel-nonce
when-fires: the end-sentinel carried a nonce that is not this attempt's. plan/records.rs admit_records (the strict admission path); the forgiving deframer emits it too. Static.
why: 306b §6e: the close marker is controller-owned framing like the header, so a wrong one means the stream is not known to have ended — the strict path refuses the whole attempt.
---
-- replay --
$ dorc plan --book=book.sh --results - < probe-results.txt
warning[records-sentinel-nonce]: sm the end-sentinel carried a nonce that is not
this attempt's -- ignored (the stream's own records are keyed independently)
